{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53087","headline":"将赴湖南湖上别皇甫曾 · 刘长卿","name":"将赴湖南湖上别皇甫曾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此去君何恨，南行我更遥。\n东西湖渺渺，离别雨潇潇。\n绿山通春谷，青山过板桥。\n浔阳如枉棹，千里有归潮。\n（见席刻《刘随州诗集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}